    "body": "Fixed the review finding at ede83592. `posting.rs` now reads the smoothing switch from each operation's own setup (`setup_post_options::of(world, op.setup)`, like `skip_stops`) instead of the active one. It's pinned by `setup_post_options::smoothing_follows_each_ops_own_setup_not_the_active_one`: Setup1 smooths and Setup2 follows the document's off, and exactly Setup1's pocket asks whichever setup is active. With the old gate it fails, because both pockets smooth when Setup1 is active. Gate: `setup_post_options` 10, `smoothing` 6, `posting` 17, `project_roundtrip` 71 and `conformance` 6 pass, and clippy `-D warnings` is clean. Flagging it ready for a fresh review.",
